{"4637490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Line Must Not Stop", "steam_appid": 4637490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LINE must not stop!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an incremental, semi-idle metro driving and management simulator set in a cyberpunk world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/fbfa58261e27c0551d9a1cff48f7a4bf.poster.avif?t=1784727897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/fbfa58261e27c0551d9a1cff48f7a4bf.webm?t=1784727897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/fbfa58261e27c0551d9a1cff48f7a4bf.mp4?t=1784727897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade your trains, transport passengers, and earn money (a lot of money!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete various missions, enhance your systems, fight off threats, and automate transit!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Construct and drive<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/fba03b8728234578592a1db27308ecaa.poster.avif?t=1784727897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/fba03b8728234578592a1db27308ecaa.webm?t=1784727897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/fba03b8728234578592a1db27308ecaa.mp4?t=1784727897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct your trains from various carriages and modules. Take control of them to transport passengers between stations in a cyberpunk-styled metro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be quick, precise, and efficient. Comply with the speed limits, watch out for the railway signals, and choose the optimal route. Perform the right actions at the right time - follow the rules and make people happy (and earn money, of course).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/3df3a4aca21f085b2189b2373fb71cf3.poster.avif?t=1784727897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/3df3a4aca21f085b2189b2373fb71cf3.webm?t=1784727897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/3df3a4aca21f085b2189b2373fb71cf3.mp4?t=1784727897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money by transporting passengers and your passive income investments. Unlock a lot of upgrades, enhancements, and multipliers that will make you rich (like, really rich) - because that's what life is all about.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/c6d486fa3672d012545f2d2991f4481e.poster.avif?t=1784727897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/c6d486fa3672d012545f2d2991f4481e.webm?t=1784727897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/c6d486fa3672d012545f2d2991f4481e.mp4?t=1784727897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock things, upgrade things, reset (while keeping a significant part of your progress and unlocking even more). Start stronger and richer each time and strive for new heights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/3b72deb83ba32a3bfdc73857db7afdd6.poster.avif?t=1784727897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/3b72deb83ba32a3bfdc73857db7afdd6.webm?t=1784727897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/3b72deb83ba32a3bfdc73857db7afdd6.mp4?t=1784727897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is a dangerous place - and you will eventually face enemies. In that case, equip your train with various guns and supportive techs. Transform your train into a moving fortress - to fight off threats and earn even more rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Automate<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/7562635d638ef6aee750bce3830a38e3.poster.avif?t=1784727897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/7562635d638ef6aee750bce3830a38e3.webm?t=1784727897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/7562635d638ef6aee750bce3830a38e3.mp4?t=1784727897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, unlock automation for various features and actions, and eventually, entire trains. Build and use many automated trains to satisfy the line's needs (and to earn even more money, obviously)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring THE LINE back to life!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LINE must not stop!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an incremental, semi-idle metro driving and management simulator set in a cyberpunk world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/fbfa58261e27c0551d9a1cff48f7a4bf.poster.avif?t=1784727897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/fbfa58261e27c0551d9a1cff48f7a4bf.webm?t=1784727897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/fbfa58261e27c0551d9a1cff48f7a4bf.mp4?t=1784727897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade your trains, transport passengers, and earn money (a lot of money!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete various missions, enhance your systems, fight off threats, and automate transit!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Construct and drive<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/fba03b8728234578592a1db27308ecaa.poster.avif?t=1784727897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/fba03b8728234578592a1db27308ecaa.webm?t=1784727897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637490/extras/fba03b8728234578592a1db27308ecaa.mp4?t=1784727897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct your trains from various carriages and modules. Take control of them to transport passengers between stations in a cyberpunk-styled metro.</